      "chunk_text": "Vedant Thakur contacted insurance agent Neha Kapoor to check on his auto policy #AV-45231, which he believed had expired. Neha confirmed that the policy ended on September 15 but was reinstated earlier that day and is now active. Neha sent the payment receipt and the updated policy document for Vedant's loan. Additionally, Vedant inquired about changing his deductible in the future, and Neha explained that he can request a quote for deductible adjustments anytime before renewal.",
